      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me out? i'm starting a paper for my history class about the causes of the israel-palestinian conflict and i'm kinda overwhelmed. can u give me a summary of the main historical drivers that led to the conflict? i just want to make sure i dont miss the big stuff for my outline.",
