    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "gotcha. but it feels like one side always gets characterized as the aggressor in different books i've read. like, when historians talk about the root causes, do they usually point to one specific thing that was the \"original sin\" or the main reason for the violence, or is it more about how one side's claims were treated compared to the other?",
